zy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and remove the radiator cooling fan\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046270.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and remove the radiator cooling fan\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046270.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the fan in place and tighten the fixing\nbolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nfan and secure the wiring to the fastening clips.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Engine electric fan motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N11</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2752486\">1048A10</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the fan in place and tighten the fixing\nbolts.</p><p>Connect the fan electrical wiring and secure\nthe wiring to the fastening clips.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><t